<title>FRANCE: Redoute top executive to join Carrefour.</title>
<headline>Redoute top executive to join Carrefour.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>French retail group Carrefour said in a statement that La Redoute managing director Joel Saveuse will join its management board in September.</p>
<p>Another statement released by the Pinault-Printemps Redoute retailer said that the group's management board chairman Serge Weinberg would temporarily fill in for Saveuse, who was leaving to &quot;pursue a career opportunity&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
